---
// src/pages/cookies.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie & Session Policy • Run My Brief">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
      
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 space-y-3">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs text-[#2563EB] hover:underline font-mono font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
          <span>&larr;</span> <span>Return to Sandbox Overview</span>
        </a>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-[#2563EB] font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Compliance &amp; Storage
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0F172A]">
          Cookie &amp; Session Storage Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- BODY CONTENT -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 1. Essential Functional Cookies &amp; Storage</h2>
          <p>
            Run My Brief uses minimal local storage and session identifiers strictly required to keep client check-in interfaces functioning. When a homeowner completes a 10-second rating card or submits a snag ticket, transient local state prevents duplicate prompt submissions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 2. No Third-Party Advertising Pixels</h2>
          <p>
            Our review-routing cards and dispatch dashboards contain no cross-site advertising cookies, behavioural retargeting scripts, or third-party data trackers. We do not sell or monetise homeowner interaction data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 3. PECR Compliance</h2>
          <p>
            Under the Privacy and Electronic Communications Regulations (PECR), strictly necessary technical identifiers used solely to provide requested interactive services do not require prior consent banners, though full transparency is maintained via this notice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 4. Enquiries</h2>
          <p>
            Questions regarding our digital storage practices can be sent directly to <a href="mailto:jimmy@runmybrief.com" class="text-[#2563EB] font-mono underline hover:text-blue-800 transition">jimmy@runmybrief.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>